      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not absolutely necessary, but it\u0027s :\n• A bugfix. Before, if an OEM had a resource set for this resource for a given mcc/mnc, it would not work.\n• MUCH simpler than the alternative, which is to add new heavy instrumentation in the test ; including simpler if you only consider the production code since that would require moving more stuff into the dependencies.\n\nThe timing is not unknown. It\u0027s reevaluateInternal(), which is called at well-known times, including when configuration changes (which is relevant here). It\u0027s also not a problem to call this if it hasn\u0027t changed, which is why I think this is safe.",
